SUMMARY:PNCR Outdoors All Day Event
DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Lancaster\, Let’s Go 123\, Lancaster Rec\, the Friends of Reservoir Park\, and the Pennsylvania Department of Conservation and Natural Resources (DCNR) for an Outdoors for All event on Saturday\, July 25\, from 11:00am to 3:00pm at Lancaster Reservoir Park\, 832 E. Orange St.\, Lancaster. \nLaunched in 2024\, Outdoors for All Day celebrates the value of accessible\, welcoming outdoor spaces across Pennsylvania. What began as a single celebration has grown into Outdoors for All Month each July. \nThis year’s event will be a fun celebration featuring organizations from across the Lancaster region that help people connect with outdoor recreation\, nature\, and community. Visitors can enjoy interactive family friendly activities\, environmental education\, games\, music\, food\, and more. \nRegistration is optional but helps event organizers plan for language interpreters and additional logistics. \nFor more information\, click here. 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/pncr-outdoors-all-day-event/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Community
END:VEVENT
