SUMMARY:City of Lancaster's South End Park Redesign & Free Ice Cream Party
DESCRIPTION:South End Park is getting a makeover! Neighbors are invited to give feedback on the plans and enjoy free ice cream. Stop by South End Park (at Beaver and Furnace Streets) anytime between 5:30 and 7pm. Spanish interpretation provided. Rain date is August 10. Register for the event to receive updates! \n\nWhere: South End Park\, at Furnace & Beaver Streets\nWhen: Monday\, July 27 – stop by anytime between 5:30 and 7pm (Aug. 10 is rain date)\nWhy? Free ice cream\, community\, give feedback on a park renovation!\n\nQuestions? Contact Emma at emhamme@cityoflancasterpa.gov \nFor more information\, click here. 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/city-of-lancasters-south-end-park-redesign-free-ice-cream-party/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Community
END:VEVENT
