SUMMARY:Lancaster Rec's Ice Cream Social
DESCRIPTION:Join Lancaster Rec for our Ice Cream Social! Cool off with us for a fun-filled summer evening at Reservoir Park Playground & Wading Pool! \nBring the whole family to enjoy: \n\nFREE Kona Ice (while supplies last)\nExtended hours at the wading pool\nWater safety information and resources from AARP\nMeet the Mayor of Lancaster City\n\nEvent Details \n\nThursday\, July 30\n5:00–7:00 PM\n832 E. Orange Street\, Lancaster\, PA 17602\n\nThis free community event is proudly sponsored by AARP and is a great way to celebrate summer while learning simple tips to help keep everyone safe around the water.
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/lancaster-recs-ice-cream-social/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Community
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR